@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #285879
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EAF4FA
left to right direction
title Public repository dependencies
component "workspace-state\nDesktop coordinator and installer" as Workspace
component "gnome-winctl\nWindow placement" as Windows
component "login-hud\nProgress and shutdown UI" as HUD
component "hide-suspend\nPower menu extension" as Suspend
component "input-source-popup-guard\nLayout popup recovery" as Guard
component "gc-profiled\nTask scheduler" as GC
Workspace --> Windows : placement requests / verification
Workspace --> HUD : progress and shutdown protocol
HUD --> Workspace : scoped actions / acknowledgements
Workspace ..> Suspend : bundled by default installer
Workspace ..> Guard : bundled by default installer
Workspace ..> GC : optional bundle component
HUD --> GC : reads status (optional)
legend bottom
Solid arrows: runtime integration
Dotted arrows: release packaging only
Window control, both small extensions and the scheduler also work independently.
endlegend
@enduml
